      "id": "S001",
      "page": 1,
      "type": "note",
      "order": 1,
      "original_text": "",
      "english_paraphrase": "The paper studies semantic fidelity using multimodal understanding and finds that reconstruction error does not reliably rank downstream performance.",
      "translation": "论文用多模态理解代理语义保真，发现特征重建误差不能可靠排序下游理解表现。",
      "source_kind": "paper-grounded-paraphrase",
      "confidence": "high",
      "bbox": null,
      "bbox_note": "section/page anchor; paragraph bbox not claimed"
    },
    {
      "id": "S002",
      "page": 3,
      "type": "note",
      "order": 2,
      "original_text": "",
      "english_paraphrase": "Adding codebooks can increase nominal capacity while their inputs become less informative. FVQ provides fixed-dimensional dense views to parallel codebooks.",
      "translation": "增加码本会提高名义容量，但各码本输入可能越来越缺信息。FVQ向并行码本提供固定维度的稠密views。",
      "source_kind": "paper-grounded-paraphrase",
      "confidence": "high",
      "bbox": null,
      "bbox_note": "section/page anchor; paragraph bbox not claimed"
    },
    {
      "id": "S003",
      "page": 5,
      "type": "note",
      "order": 3,
      "original_text": "",
      "english_paraphrase": "A frozen visual encoder feeds projections and quantizers. Tokenizer training reconstructs features; later multimodal training consumes IDs through newly learned embeddings.",
      "translation": "冻结视觉编码器提供特征，经投影与量化得到ID。tokenizer训练重建特征；后续多模态模型通过新学embeddings读取ID。",
      "source_kind": "paper-grounded-paraphrase",
      "confidence": "high",
      "bbox": null,
      "bbox_note": "section/page anchor; paragraph bbox not claimed"
    },
    {
      "id": "C001",
      "page": 5,
      "type": "caption",
      "order": 4,
      "original_text": "",
      "english_paraphrase": "Fig.3: tokenizer and multimodal training use different paths",
      "translation": "上：tokenizer重建支路与VLM读ID支路；下：多个稠密投影与并行码本。",
      "confidence": "high",
      "bbox": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S004",
      "page": 4,
      "type": "note",
      "order": 5,
      "original_text": "",
      "english_paraphrase": "The odd-group residual representation has higher MSE than single-codebook VQ but stronger understanding. Sixteen-codebook FVQ reaches a higher eight-benchmark average than the continuous baseline.",
      "translation": "RVQ奇数组合的MSE比单VQ高，理解均值却更好；16码本FVQ在八项平均上接近并超过所列连续基线。",
      "source_kind": "paper-grounded-paraphrase",
      "confidence": "high",
      "bbox": null,
      "bbox_note": "section/page anchor; paragraph bbox not claimed"
    },
    {
      "id": "C002",
      "page": 4,
      "type": "caption",
      "order": 6,
      "original_text": "",
      "english_paraphrase": "Table1: feature MSE versus understanding",
      "translation": "Table1展示更大MSE可以对应更高理解均值；OCRBench除10后参与平均。",
      "confidence": "high",
      "bbox": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S005",
      "page": 7,
      "type": "note",
      "order": 7,
      "original_text": "",
      "english_paraphrase": "Industrial training uses four large stages. Nine-metric relative gains over discrete competitors and eight-metric controlled averages are separate comparisons.",
      "translation": "工业训练有四个大规模阶段；对离散竞争者的九指标相对增幅，与受控实验的八指标均值是两种比较。",
      "source_kind": "paper-grounded-paraphrase",
      "confidence": "high",
      "bbox": null,
      "bbox_note": "section/page anchor; paragraph bbox not claimed"
    },
    {
      "id": "S006",
      "page": 17,
      "type": "note",
      "order": 8,
      "original_text": "",
      "english_paraphrase": "Tight-frame synthesis is exact before quantization. It does not prove that nearest-codeword replacement preserves every task-relevant distinction.",
      "translation": "tight-frame合成在量化前可精确恢复；这不证明最近码字替换保留所有任务相关区分。",
      "source_kind": "paper-grounded-paraphrase",
      "confidence": "high",
      "bbox": null,
      "bbox_note": "section/page anchor; paragraph bbox not claimed"
    },
